ou uploa"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"d images in one step and automatically copies the resulting link—so you can stay focused on creating"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"step and automatically copies the resulting link—so you can stay focused on creating, not uploading."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Supported Image hosts"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"PicGo supports mainstream Image hosts out of the box, and can be extended indefinitely through its p"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"s mainstream Image hosts out of the box, and can be extended indefinitely through its plugin system:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **China cloud vendors**: Qiniu, Tencent Cloud COS, UPYUN, Alibaba Cloud OSS\n- **International / op"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"en platforms**: GitHub, SM.MS(S.EE), Imgur\n- **More options via plugins**: AWS S3, Cloudflare R2, Mi"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"*: GitHub, SM.MS(S.EE), Imgur\n- **More options via plugins**: AWS S3, Cloudflare R2, MinIO, and more"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> **Note**: PicGo itself will no longer add new third-party Image hosts by default. You can build Im"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"age host plugins yourself—see PicGo-Core."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## ✨ Key Features"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"PicGo is built around a fast, low-friction image upload experience:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### ⚡ Smooth writing flow\n- **Auto-copy links**: once an upload finishes, the link is copied to your"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" clipboard automatically.\n- **Flexible formats**: Markdown, HTML, URL, custom templates—paste direct"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ly into any editor.\n- **Zero-Context Switching**: Don't switch windows. Just paste images directly i"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"nto your favorite editor, and let PicGo handle the upload in the background.\n- _Enable this workflow"},{"id":"p18s5","text":" via native support or community plugins:_ Obsidian \\ VS Code \\ Typora \\ Neovim \\ MarkText \\ SiYuan "},{"id":"p18s6","text":"upport or community plugins:_ Obsidian \\ VS Code \\ Typora \\ Neovim \\ MarkText \\ SiYuan \\ And more..."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 🚀 Fast uploads\n- **Multiple ways to upload**: drag & drop, paste from clipboard, hotkeys, and ev"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"en right-click context menu upload on macOS/Windows.\n- **Global hotkey**: press `Command+Shift+U` (m"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"acOS) / `Ctrl+Shift+U` (Windows/Linux) to open the upload window without leaving your current app. T"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"he global key can be customized."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 🧩 Powerful plugin ecosystem\n- **Highly extensible**: plugins already exist for AWS S3, Cloudflar"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"e R2, MinIO, and many other Image hosts.\n- **Even more possibilities**: image compression, watermark"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ing, renaming, Markdown image migration, and more.\n- Explore plugins: Awesome-PicGo"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 🤖 AI-friendly\nMore and more writing is handed off to AI. But the screenshots and charts it produ"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ces sit on your disk as `![](./chart.png)`, and they need to become real links before you publish. P"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"icGo lets AI upload them too:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **PicGo Skills**: official Agent Skills that teach AI when and how to upload. Works with any AI to"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ol that supports the skills format."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **DeepSeek Harness plugin**: install it in dsh and your agent can upload to your image host on its"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"eepSeek Harness plugin**: install it in dsh and your agent can upload to your image host on its own."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Both reuse the image hosts and plugins you already configured in PicGo—nothing to set up twice. Read"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"e hosts and plugins you already configured in PicGo—nothing to set up twice. Read more in this post."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### 🛠 Developer-friendly\n- **HTTP API**: upload via HTTP requests (v2.2.0+), making it easy to integ"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"rate with other tools.\n- **Open source**: fully open-source and transparent.\n- **Great documentation"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"**: detailed docs help you get started quickly. For plugin development, see the PicGo-Core docs."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"> There’s more to discover—development progress is tracked in Projects."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"If you’re new to PicGo, start with the User Guide. If you run into issues, check the FAQ and closed "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"re new to PicGo, start with the User Guide. If you run into issues, check the FAQ and closed issues."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Download & Install"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Source                                                                           | Link / Installa"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"tion                                         | Platform   | Notes                                   "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ion                                         | Platform   | Notes                                   |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| GitHub Releases                                                                  | https://github."},{"id":"p32s2","text":"com/Molunerfinn/PicGo/releases               | All        | Downloads may be slow in mainland China "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"|\n| Shandong University mirror                        | https://mirrors.sdu.edu.cn/github-release/Mo"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"lunerfinn_PicGo | All        | Thanks to the mirror for hosting        |\n| Scoop                    "},{"id":"p32s5","text":"                                   | `scoop bucket add extras` & `scoop install picgo`           | W"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"indows    | Thanks to @huangnauh and @Gladtbam      |\n| Chocolatey                                  "},{"id":"p32s7","text":"          | `choco install picgo`                                       | Windows    | Thanks to @iY"},{"id":"p32s8","text":"ato                        |\n| Homebrew                               